      "url": "https://www.teads.com/about-teads/",
      "description": "About Teads: Our Story, Mission, Culture & Values - Teads Skip to main content Skip to footer For Advertisers Enterprise Growing Brands Ad Formats Teads Studio Creative Showcase Teads Awards For Media Owners Media Owners Media Owners Showcase Company About Us Careers Leadership Offices Investors Resources Blog Case Studies Teads Academy Ad Policies Ad Specifications Omnichannel Advertising CTV Advertising Contact Us Login Contact Us Login Elevating Outcomes In a world where digital advertising was once dominated by walled gardens, we saw an opportunity—a better way to connect brands with consumers in meaningful, measurable ways. Led with a vision to transform the open internet into a thriving ecosystem for advertisers, publishers, and audiences alike, we are redefining what’s possible in omnichannel marketing. We are the omnichannel outcomes platform for the open internet. Contact Us Our Mission We’re here to empower brands to create connected consumer experiences that drive real results, from awareness to performance. We do that with commitment to innovation and an AI-powered platform that delivers real outcomes across screens. By seamlessly integrating creativity, data, and technology, we help brands captivate their audiences with engaging ad experiences and measurable impact. 0 + Employees 0 + Countries 0 K Advertisers 0 K+ Publishers Expect More Our Values Our values guide how we work, innovate, and collaborate — driving us to push boundaries and set new standards for success. Value 01 We have a relentless, customer focus Customers (including internal) are at the core of the technologies that we build and the processes that we create. We put their needs first, ensuring their success is the driving force behind all our actions Value 02 We act today, not tomorrow We’re decisive, and we’re not afraid to take deliberate risks. We act with urgency and resolve, using the data we have as our driver. When decisions are reversible, we act fast and keep moving forward Value 03 We obsess, about outcomes We’re high achievers with a drive to deliver results (and not obsess with processes). We have a bias for action that delivers impact and we take full accountability for seeing our work through and delivering on our commitments on time Value 04 We evolve, through change We’re built to continue to transform - we are bold in our thinking and are excited about the possibilities that changes can bring. Value 05 We are human driven, powered by Ai We’re powered by AI, but it’s our people who make the difference. We show up as we are and we fuel one another with trust and respect. We continuously expand our toolbox, professionally and personally. We’re here to build great things together and we love to have fun while we’re doing it! Our Values Our values guide how we work, innovate, and collaborate — driving us to push boundaries and set new standards for success. Value 01 We have a relentless, customer focus Customers (including internal) are at the core of the technologies that we build and the processes that we create. We put their needs first, ensuring their success is the driving force behind all our actions Value 02 We act today, not tomorrow We’re decisive, and we’re not afraid to take deliberate risks. We act with urgency and resolve, using the data we have as our driver. When decisions are reversible, we act fast and keep moving forward Value 03 We obsess, about outcomes We’re high achievers with a drive to deliver results (and not obsess with processes). We have a bias for action that delivers impact and we take full accountability for seeing our work through and delivering on our commitments on time Value 04 We evolve, through change We’re built to continue to transform - we are bold in our thinking and are excited about the possibilities that changes can bring. Value 05 We are human driven, powered by Ai We’re powered by AI, but it’s our people who make the difference. We show up as we are and we fuel one another with trust and respect. We continuously expand our toolbox, professionally and personally. We’re here to build great things together and we love to have fun while we’re doing it! Swipe to see more Teads isn’t just about technology—it’s about people. We foster a culture where innovation thrives, where strategists, technologists, and creatives collaborate to push the boundaries of digital advertising. Join us on this journey. The future of advertising starts here. Join Us Recognized Across the Industry Shaping the future of innovation and success, together with our clients and partners. Teads is the platform to create better, connected consumer experiences across screens — that drive real outcomes from branding to performance. For Advertisers Advertisers Teads Studio Creative Showcase Teads Awards Teads Academy Ad Policies For Media Owners Media Owners Media Owners Showcase Company About Us Careers Leadership Offices Blog Investors Engineering at Teads Privacy & Legal Site Visitors Privacy Policy Advertising Privacy Policy Exercise your rights Terms of Use Legal Mentions Brand Safety Policy Ad Policies Modern Slavery Act Statement Do Not Sell My Information Site Visitors Privacy Policy Website Cookie Policy Security at Teads Cookie Settings User Privacy Policy English Français 日本語 Deutsch Español Italiano 中文 (简体)",
