      "url": "https://www.teads.com/lp/connected-tv-advertising/",
      "description": "CTV Advertising Solutions | Teads Skip to main content Skip to footer For Advertisers Enterprise Growing Brands Ad Formats Teads Studio Creative Showcase Teads Awards For Media Owners Media Owners Media Owners Showcase Company About Us Careers Leadership Offices Investors Resources Blog Case Studies Teads Academy Ad Policies Ad Specifications Omnichannel Advertising CTV Advertising Contact Us Login Contact Us Login Connected TV Advertising That Works Across Every Outcome Teads is the trusted omnichannel partner bringing CTV, premium media, creative, data and AI-powered technology together to create cohesive experiences across screens — and measurable outcomes across the funnel. Contact a CTV Expert Explore CTV formats Connected TV is More Than a Moment on the Big Screen CTV has become an essential part of how brands reach audiences, but it is still often planned in isolation. That can create a gap between the attention a brand earns on TV and how people engage elsewhere. Teads closes that gap. We connect CTV with mobile and the premium open internet, helping brands carry one cohesive story across screens, guide consumers from awareness to action, and understand how CTV contributes across the journey. New to CTV? Explore our guide to Connected TV advertising . Why Top Brands Partner with Teads for CTV Premium Media Reach audiences across leading Smart TV platforms, including Google TV, Samsung, LG, TCL and Hisense, alongside premium streaming environments. Teads offers high-quality placements designed to earn attention without disrupting the viewing experience. Creative Intelligence Teads Studio helps brands make the most of CTV creative and carry the same story across screens. From deploying high-impact 3D creative takeovers on the HomeScreen to running automated Localized Ads that dynamically drive foot traffic to nearby store locations, each execution is adapted to its environment and role in the consumer journey. Unique Data Solutions Through Teads’ Omnichannel Graph and first-party data, advertisers can extend web targeting to CTV to reach audiences during specific moments of intent or life stages. AI-Powered Optimization Understand what happens after the big-screen exposure. CTV Performance connects CTV campaigns with qualified site visits, store traffic and conversions, supported by attention and measurement partnerships with Adelaide, Lumen and TVision. CTV Formats Explained CTV ads can reach viewers before and during streaming content, while also helping drive action afterward. Explore where each format appears and the role it can play in a broader media strategy. CTV HomeScreen Reach viewers as they decide what to watch. HomeScreen ads appear within a Smart TV’s main interface, giving brands high visibility before content begins. Teads HomeScreen formats achieve a 48% human attention rate — 16% higher than YouTube skippable pre-roll. View HomeScreen Specifications CTV InStream Reach viewers within streaming content. These 15- and 30-second full-screen, sound-on ads run within broadcaster apps and FAST environments. By avoiding cluttered ad breaks, CTV InStream ads typically achieve video completion rates above 95%, outperforming traditional social video benchmarks. View InStream Specifications CTV Performance Connect TV exposure with action. Backed by predictive machine learning algorithms, this solution shifts delivery toward households most likely to take action, reducing the cost per quality site visit by up to 79%. View CTV Performance Specifications Explore CTV Formats One Platform for Outcomes: Teads Ad Manager From planning to reporting, TAM gives you the tools to drive traffic, leads, and sales, without complexity. Reach Direct access to premium inventory across every screen Plan Exclusive signals, contextual intelligence, and forecasting Deliver Outcome-based buying with formats designed to convert Measure Transparent, cross-device reporting and optimization Get the skills and confidence to plan, launch, and optimize in TAM. Get Certified A Viewable Ad Is Not Always a Viewed Ad Raw viewability simply confirms that an ad pixel loaded in the background of a device. It doesn't mean a human actually looked at it. Teads helps brands plan and optimize CTV campaigns around genuine human attention, supported by research and measurement partners. 0 % Human Attention Rate Achieved by native CTV HomeScreen formats, outperforming standard skippable pre-roll by 16% and driving an industry-leading 50% unaided brand recall. Source: Teads x MediaMento Institute Attention Analysis, 2025 CTV Success Stories on the Big Screen Retail Omnichannel Strategy Elevates Awareness & Consideration for Gucci Beauty +29% Attention (APM) vs. beauty benchmark Read Case Study CPG Heineken’s CTV HomeScreen Activity Delivers 2.3x Uplift in Ad Awareness vs. Brand Norms +97% Ad recall for full-screen Read Case Study Automotive CTV Performance Campaign Delivers Engaged Site Visits for Audi +34K Engaged site visits Read Case Study All CTV Case Studies Make the second screen part of the story Major cultural events draw the most attentive audiences in the world, but a big-screen exposure shouldn’t live in an isolated silo. Because viewers naturally split their attention between the TV and their phones, second-screening is an opportunity for audience expansion, not a distraction. Teads unifies this behavior by serving high-impact native formats on CTV while simultaneously triggering sequential, lower-funnel messaging across our premium open-web publisher network—driving up to a 65% lift in brand recall. Ready to scale your seasonal live event strategy? See how to benefit from CTV Advertising during major sports moments. Master the Screen: Essential Connected TV Insights 2026 CTV Ensemble Announcement Teads CTV Ensemble is a comprehensive suite providing a single global access point for high-attention formats and measurable results – from brand storytelling to bottom-line performance. Read Article 2025 UK CTV Pul",
