      "title": "Engineering at Teads",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://engineering.teads.com/",
      "description": "Teads Engineering — Future of Advertising at Planet Scale Skip to main content Skip to footer Opens in a new tab Tech Challenges Sustainability Locations Blog Events WIT Tech Challenges Sustainability Locations Events Women in Tech See Open Roles Join Us Join Us Engineering the Future of Advertising at Planet Scale Every month, Teads Engineering powers respectful, sustainable advertising reaching 2.2 billion people . We build the technology that connects the world’s top publishers with the most prestigious advertisers — at speed, scale, and impact. Explore Our Tech Challenges See Open Roles What We Build The advertising ecosystem is one of the most complex arenas in technology. At Teads, our engineers solve challenges across every domain of modern software engineering: Massive Scale 18B ad opportunities/day, 8M requests per second Distributed Infrastructure 500+ microservices across global data centers Code Across the Internet ads that run seamlessly across devices, browsers, apps, CTV Machine Learning at Scale 1B predictions/sec powering personalization & optimization Intuitive Products advanced yet simple tools for publishers & advertisers With 400+ engineers in 4 global hubs , we innovate daily to keep Teads at the forefront of adtech. Explore Our Tech Challenges Voices of Our Tech Leaders Every day, we’re solving challenging engineering problems, leveraging AI on complex data-sets, building Cloud-native technology at scale, and having lots of fun in the process. Damien Islam-Frenoy Chief Technology Officer Working at Teads means you don't have to choose between cutting-edge work and personal growth. We're constantly pushing the boundaries with innovative tech to hit our business goals, but there's a deep-seated commitment to helping engineers thrive in their own careers and building a strong, diverse team culture. Eloise Ann Friedman Director of Platform X At Teads we deal with large continously trained models that deliver 1B predictions per second. Each improvement can have a direct business impact that can often be observed within hours. It is a truly unique problem space to work in. Andraž Tori SVP, Chief Scientist We collaborate daily with our peers across the world on solving deep technical challenges at extreme scale. It's an exciting and demanding environment that provides an unparalleled opportunity for any engineer to grow! Florjan Bartol VP Engineering, DSP & Video Our main goal in the Teads tech team is to deliver quality business-driven products at a very high velocity on a planet-scale platform. Robert Dupuy VP Engineering Swipe to see more Inside Teads Engineering We believe great work happens when people grow, connect, and enjoy the ride. Engineering Culture “you build it, you run it, you monitor it” Borderless Collaboration Working together across teams, offices, and regions Learning & Growth Tech talks, trainings, and conferences to grow together Innovation Moments Hackathons, meetups, and summits to spark new ideas Discover Careers at Teads Women in tech Equity at Teads Shaping the future of tech through inclusion, innovation, and leadership. Explore Women in Tech initiative Our Engineering Hubs From the Mediterranean to the heart of Paris — our hubs are where innovation meets community. Tour Our Offices: Paris Office Our Engineering hub in Paris sits at the crossroads of culture, business, and cutting-edge technology. Netanya Office Our seaside Engineering hub in Israel, located in a dynamic innovation ecosystem along the Mediterranean coast. Montpellier Office Our Engineering hub in Montpellier combines Mediterranean lifestyle with a thriving tech and research ecosystem. Ljubljana Office Our Engineering hub is nestled in the charming Slovenian capital, surrounded by nature and a vibrant tech scene. Join Us in Building the Future of Sustainable Advertising Be part of a team solving some of the hardest problems in adtech — with global impact and real innovation. Join Us See Open Roles Teads is the platform to create better, connected consumer experiences across screens — that drive real outcomes from branding to performance. For Advertisers Advertisers Teads Studio Creative Showcase Teads Awards Teads Academy Ad Policies For Media Owners Media Owners Media Owners Showcase Company About Us Careers Leadership Offices Blog Investors Engineering at Teads Privacy & Legal Site Visitors Privacy Policy Advertising Privacy Policy Exercise your rights Terms of Use Legal Mentions Brand Safety Policy Ad Policies Modern Slavery Act Statement Do Not Sell My Information Site Visitors Privacy Policy Website Cookie Policy Security at Teads Cookie Settings",
